                    {
                        "sense_id": "07ff471a-39c3-393a-91d2-aafbbfca295c",
                        "entry_id": "517b4d79-cacb-3acf-8345-3d5eb67d51e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resting on the bed of a body of water rather than floating; on or onto a shore or beach. (of a watercraft)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c884e6d4-91fd-4462-92e2-0b6f1c60e5eb",
                                "sense_id": "07ff471a-39c3-393a-91d2-aafbbfca295c",
                                "text": "[…] I had news by the Chirurgeon, how that my Ships-company that betook themselvs to flight with the Shallop were run astrand on the Scemkal or Dagestan Coast, a Countrey butting out against the Caspian Sea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7808f315-d793-4c64-93d7-869ab475c10d",
                                "sense_id": "07ff471a-39c3-393a-91d2-aafbbfca295c",
                                "text": "As the tall ship, whose lofty prore\nShall never stem the billows more,\nDeserted by her gallant band,\nAmid the breakers lies astrand,—"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9fdba6f-3471-402a-9fd7-767876e701bd",
                                "sense_id": "07ff471a-39c3-393a-91d2-aafbbfca295c",
                                "text": "There were some boats and barges astrand in the mud,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2d650e2-38b0-492d-be59-ea680454dd04",
                                "sense_id": "07ff471a-39c3-393a-91d2-aafbbfca295c",
                                "text": "[…] he slipped and lay face down in the running stream and was hauled astrand."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
